<view class="screen screen-auth">
  <view class="auth-intro-card">
    <view class="auth-brand-row">
      <text class="auth-brand-pill">Health Manager</text>
      <text class="auth-brand-pill auth-brand-pill-soft">固定公式 + 规则引擎</text>
    </view>
    <view class="hero-title">轻养</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">先浏览食物热量和健康管理方法；需要保存记录、同步微信运动或参加好友挑战时，再自主选择登录。</view>
    <view class="auth-highlight-grid">
      <view class="auth-highlight-card">
        <text class="auth-highlight-title">记录一体</text>
        <text class="auth-highlight-copy">饮食、运动、睡眠和体重统一回到一个账户里。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="auth-highlight-card">
        <text class="auth-highlight-title">规则透明</text>
        <text class="auth-highlight-copy">目标和建议都按固定规则生成，不走黑盒推荐。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card guest-card">
    <view class="auth-form-head">
      <text class="auth-form-kicker">先体验</text>
      <view class="section-title">食物热量浏览</view>
      <view class="section-caption">无需登录即可搜索常见食物，查看每 100 克热量和蛋白质。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="guest-search-row">
      <input class="input guest-search-input" placeholder="例如：米饭、鸡蛋、苹果" value="{{foodQuery}}" bindinput="handleFoodQuery" confirm-type="search" bindconfirm="searchFoods" />
      <button class="guest-search-button" loading="{{foodLoading}}" disabled="{{foodLoading}}" bindtap="searchFoods">搜索</button>
    </view>
    <view class="guest-result-list" wx:if="{{foodResults.length}}">
      <view class="guest-result" wx:for="{{foodResults}}" wx:key="id">
        <view>
          <view class="guest-result-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="guest-result-meta">{{item.category}} · 蛋白质 {{item.protein}}g / 100g</view>
        </view>
        <view class="guest-result-kcal">{{item.calories}}<text> kcal</text></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="guest-empty" wx:elif="{{foodSearched}}">没有找到匹配食物，换一个名称试试。</view>
    <view class="guest-tips" wx:else>
      <view class="guest-tip"><text class="guest-tip-number">01</text><text>记录以长期趋势为准，不用追求每一餐都完美。</text></view>
      <view class="guest-tip"><text class="guest-tip-number">02</text><text>规律睡眠和日常步行，同样会影响体重管理。</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card auth-form-card">
    <view class="auth-form-head">
      <text class="auth-form-kicker">登录后保存</text>
      <view class="section-title">保存你的健康记录</view>
      <view class="section-caption">登录后可记录饮食、运动、睡眠和体重；微信运动同步与好友挑战也在登录后由你主动开启。</view>
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">用户名</text>
      <input class="input" placeholder="请输入用户名" value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="handleInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">密码</text>
      <input class="input" password placeholder="请输入密码" value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="handleInput" />
    </view>

    <view class="auth-tip">账号密码登录完全可选；不会在打开小程序时自动请求微信授权、头像、昵称或手机号。</view>

    <button class="button auth-primary-button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="submit">账号密码登录</button>
    <button class="button-secondary auth-secondary-button" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="wechatLogin">微信登录（可选）</button>
    <view class="auth-password-row">
      <text class="auth-password-link" bindtap="showPasswordResetHelp">忘记密码</text>
    </view>
    <button class="button-secondary auth-secondary-button" bindtap="goRegister">没有账号，创建健康档案</button>
  </view>
</view>
